        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning key layouts isn’t just about typing games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master typing while having fun with “Key Riot”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/11063c9d2f2ba73eca69a6f090ef9011.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Riot Keys are running wild across the screen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the rampaging “Riot Keys” with your mouse and drag &amp; drop them back to their correct positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to see how fast you can restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you are, the higher your rank—aim for the ultimate S Rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/ea280637f812927402ad2df22093e2f0.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the Riot Keys by typing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press A and the “A” Riot Key freezes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press B and the “B” Riot Key freezes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes—each one clearly yells “Ouch!” when hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your typing skills to stop the chaos as quickly as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/3bab7c3f59900e620dd443c2faf209f1.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But hit them too much and the “Super Riot” begins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you over-hit the keys, the Super Riot will trigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this state, the keys won’t stop no matter how many times you press them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/0da758115640b2d36c143dbc92d0b1c6.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you’re safe once they’re back in place? Think again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after returning them to their original positions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the Riot Keys may escape again at random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’ll start trembling right before they run—hit them to stop the breakout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/38e2a8b2ba66fa47c8ae6423dbe9bf45.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four key layouts included!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QWERTY · AZERTY · QWERTZ · DVORAK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new layouts and learn them naturally as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also read simple explanations in the in-game dictionary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/22cbdf30722bda5b7f36588194dda769.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work hard and earn achievements!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn them by getting S Rank, calming riots without hitting keys, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting all achievements may unlock special artwork drawn by a professional artist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Everything else is drawn by Makimura.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/6c771d3e8e7a10f282fc0cf16e19e931.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/6c771d3e8e7a10f282fc0cf16e19e931.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">　　</span> Special Thanks <span class=\"bb_strike\">　　</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design Advisor</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seiji</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Providers</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shunsuke Horiuchi (Jaken)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koki Sakoda</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuga Aoki</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kobe Denshi College</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">　　 　　　　　　　 　　</span></p>",
