"bb_paragraph\" >(Everything else is drawn by Makimura.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/6c771d3e8e7a10f282fc0cf16e19e931.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/6c771d3e8e7a10f282fc0cf16e19e931.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">　　</span> Special Thanks <span class=\"bb_strike\">　　</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design Advisor</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seiji</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Providers</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shunsuke Horiuchi (Jaken)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koki Sakoda</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuga Aoki</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kobe Denshi College</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">　　 　　　　　　　 　　</span></p>",
